    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "k5p98w7",
      "content": "• Extends from 35 km to 2900 km."
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "The upper mantle contains the asthenosphere, a semi-fluid layer upon which the rigid lithosphere floats.",
      "id": "xlio49i"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dovh0dc",
      "content": "• Upper mantle includes lithosphere and asthenosphere."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "6qacics",
      "content": "• Asthenosphere (100–350 km) is partially molten."
    },
